&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="key-capabilities"&gt;Key Capabilities&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="key-capabilities"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#key-capabilities" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automatic Fault Recovery&lt;/strong&gt;: Degraded chunks are automatically detected and restored to maintain replication invariants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Append-Focused Streaming&lt;/strong&gt;: Optimized for large sequential writes and concurrent reader streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zero Metadata Contention&lt;/strong&gt;: Chunk servers independently manage physical I/O without querying the Master on each read operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>